graph LR
    Deployer["llm-d-deployer<br/>Helm chart llm-d v1.0.23<br/>DEPRECATED"]

    %% External Dependencies
    Deployer -->|kubeVersion >= 1.30| K8s[Kubernetes API]
    Deployer -->|helper library| Common["Bitnami common 2.27.0"]
    Deployer -.->|optional KV index| RedisChart["Bitnami redis 20.13.4"]
    Deployer -->|CRDs| GIE["Gateway API + GIE CRDs<br/>InferencePool/Model v1alpha2"]
    Deployer -->|default gateway| Istio["Istio 1.27 alpha<br/>gcr.io/istio-testing"]
    Deployer -.->|alt gateway| KGW["kgateway v2.0.3"]
    Deployer -.->|alt gateway| GKE["GKE L7 gateway classes"]
    Deployer -.->|ServiceMonitor| PromOp["Prometheus Operator /<br/>kube-prometheus-stack"]
    Deployer -.->|dashboards| GrafOp["Grafana Operator"]
    Deployer -->|GPU presets| GPU["NVIDIA GPU Operator"]

    %% Internal Platform Dependencies
    Deployer -->|controller image + CRD| MS["llm-d-model-service"]
    Deployer -->|EPP image + CRD source| Sched["llm-d-inference-scheduler<br/>llm-d-router"]
    Deployer -->|vLLM image| LLMD["llm-d vLLM image"]
    Deployer -->|decode P/D proxy| RS["llm-d-routing-sidecar"]
    Deployer -.->|sim preset| Sim["llm-d-inference-sim"]
    Deployer -.->|KV-cache scoring| KV["llm-d-kv-cache"]
    Deployer -.->|metrics| UWM["OpenShift UWM /<br/>Thanos Querier"]

    %% Integration Points
    Argo["Argo CD example"] -.->|OCI chart install| Deployer
    Infra["llm-d-infra"] -->|supersedes| Deployer
    KServe["KServe LLMInferenceService"] -->|replaces in RHOAI| Deployer

    %% External Services
    Deployer -->|model download| HF["Hugging Face Hub"]
    Deployer -->|images| Reg["ghcr.io / quay.io"]

